{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version of <i>\u201cDesktop Cat Story\u201d</i> lets you experience a portion of the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable up to <strong>Hard I Chapter</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution available up to <strong>Noble Cat tier</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to the <strong>first Shelter room (Dream Room)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd8 Game Info</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Cat Story</strong> is a healing idle RPG that runs fixed at the bottom of your screen.  <br>Earn resources through auto-battles with cute cats, and unlock new furniture and rooms!  <br>Merge two cats to evolve them\u2014satisfy your urge to collect them all.  <br>Even while you're working or studying, the cats keep moving and waiting for you.  <br>Relax and enjoy a gentle experience with your feline friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude3a Meet a Variety of Unique Cats!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fur color and personality to abilities, every cat is full of charm!  <br>Some are mischievous, some are big eaters\u2014each with their own quirks.  <br>Collect them all and complete your adorable cat collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc4a Defeat Nightmares with Your Cats!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your cats to fend off nightmare monsters  <br>so your owner can finally get a peaceful night\u2019s sleep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004840/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.poster.avif?t=1757917357\" width=944 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004840/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.webm?t=1757917357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004840/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.mp4?t=1757917357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf56 Care for the Cats in Your Room!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your hungry cats,  <br>and clean up loose fur from time to time.  <br>Bond with your feline companions as you share your daily life together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004840/extras/f152139f65fa23393e898422429e7d40.poster.avif?t=1757917357\" width=928 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004840/extras/f152139f65fa23393e898422429e7d40.webm?t=1757917357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004840/extras/f152139f65fa23393e898422429e7d40.mp4?t=1757917357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Merge and Evolve Your Cats!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge duplicate cats to evolve them into stronger, even cuter versions!  <br>Enjoy both the thrill of growth and the fun of collecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004840/extras/078c3a2bae400c1d4e5b8d1353d7fc19.poster.avif?t=1757917357\" width=1170 height=324 ><source s